WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.780
With buckets of blood and a brand new round
of crude jokes, 2018's The Predator is, if

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:10.139
nothing else, a predator movie, building on
the lore established in the previous five

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.980
movies while expanding on the franchise in
its own way.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.100
It all comes together in a lightning quick
climax, so we're going to slow it down and

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.740
take a look at what actually happened at the
end of The Predator.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.180
Turn on your heat vision, because we're getting
into some major spoilers.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.120
Traitor

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.980
The Predator jumps into the plot from the
very first scene, which sees Boyd Holbrook's

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:34.480
Quinn McKenna on an assassination mission
in Mexico, when he's interrupted by a crashing

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.040
spaceship.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.680
As the movie progresses, it's revealed that
the alien who crash landed on top of Quinn

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.480
didn't come to Earth to top off his collection
of people spines, as Predators tend to do.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:49.220
He's actually a traitor who was trying to
save humanity from an invasion by the predators

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:51.440
by bringing a gift to help humans fight back.

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:52.340
Good for him!

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.980
Unfortunately, he's killed by an upgraded
predator, but his mysterious gift lived on

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.080
until the ending of the movie.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:00.400
Memory map

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.759
Even though Traeger knows that there's something
really important on the predator's crashed

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.300
ship, he has a problem: he doesn't know how
to get there.

00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:10.420
Fortunately, Quinn's son, Rory, knows everything.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:14.640
With his apparent photographic memory, he's
a living trapper keeper of all he sees.

00:01:14.789 --> 00:01:18.600
At some point while messing around with the
alien gadgets in his basement, he must have

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.400
come across some kind of record of the flight
path the ship made when it crashed.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.880
So what does he do?

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.740
He starts drawing a map that leads directly
to the alien ship while he's being held prisoner

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.860
by the exact men who want to find the ship.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.140
Traeger and his goons head there to ransack
the ship, with Quinn and his loons in hot

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.620
pursuit to get Rory back.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.940
But there's someone else heading there, too.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.000
Someone...predatory.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.440
The game begins

00:01:42.889 --> 00:01:47.159
If there's one thing The Predator gets right,
it's giving the alien plenty of people to

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:47.700
dismember.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:50.000
That's what these movies are all about, after
all.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.200
After crashing the party at the downed spaceship,
the predator has all the humans in the palm

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:54.740
of his hand.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.440
All he has to do is start shooting.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.080
And then… he gives them all a head start
before he chases them?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:00.820
What?

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.800
Actually, this one makes sense.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.400
He's a predator, after all.

00:02:04.609 --> 00:02:08.500
The thrill of the kill is in the hunt, not
massacring a group of people who can't fight

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.000
back.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.840
Now that he did what he came to do - destroying
that mysterious "gift" on the ship - he's

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.040
ready for some R&amp;R.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.780
Who doesn't like to kick back after a stressful
business trip?

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.460
So he evens the odds by giving the humans
a head start, then gets down to his favorite

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:22.600
hobby: murder.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.440
"Oh boy, here I go killing again."

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.140
One true warrior

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:32.020
As the predator explains the rules of the
game to all the confused humans, he name drops

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:35.100
McKenna as the "one true warrior" who is his
main target.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.440
Naturally, being an actual, adult warrior,
Quinn assumes the predator is talking about

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:39.940
him.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:44.840
He leads his group into the woods, where they
concoct a plan to ambush the psychotic monster.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:46.360
Things go south almost immediately.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.620
One by one, they all get taken out, and the
predator makes a beeline for Quinn… then

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:55.180
shoves him aside and grabs Rory, revealing
the boy to be the one true warrior.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:59.960
In the aftermath, Casey repeats her earlier
line about people on the autism spectrum being

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.020
the next step in the evolutionary chain.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.790
When the predators upgrade themselves with
human DNA, they want Rory's chromosomes coursing

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.380
through their veins.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.540
Escape pod

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:14.320
Before he started hunting everyone at the
end, the ultra predator blew up the ship that

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.740
the traitor predator had been using to bring
humanity their special gift.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:22.000
But as the final scene explains, the traitor
was extremely thorough in making sure that

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.720
package made it to the right people.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:28.120
In case he got caught, he left a failsafe
in place that caused the gift to eject from

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:29.480
the ship in an escape pod.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:34.180
After Quinn defeated the predator, the government
apparently went into damage control and swept

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.640
the area to clean up the fallout.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.760
Remember, they've known about predators for
decades - they're not about to let the secret

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:40.500
get out now.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.860
In their search, they came across the escape
pod containing the secret weapon, ensuring

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:48.320
the continued existence of humanity when the
predators launch their attack.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.140
New suit

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.420
So what was in that pod?

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.200
What was the mysterious gift that will save
mankind?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.980
Short answer - a super duper robot suit.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:02.540
After a few seconds of dramatic tension, the
pod opens and pops out an arm band.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:07.050
One of the lab guys gets it on his arm, and
presto change-o, he's engulfed in a high tech

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:07.880
predator suit.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.540
What can one fancy exoskeleton do against
an army of predators?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:12.360
Who knows!

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:16.580
But Quinn immediately claims the suit for
himself, potentially setting up a sequel.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.699
Whether that sequel will ever happen most
likely depends on how The Predator does at

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.580
the box office, so for now we'll all have
to wait.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.220
But hey, at least he got a new suit!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.300
Who doesn't love that?

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.440
"Buy new suits.

00:04:27.449 --> 00:04:27.450
Yay!"

